User: I'll be arriving in London on March 15th. Last year, I stayed at the 'London Luxury Hotel', which had amazing reviews and ratings. It was super quiet and clean, and my room had a view of the Thames River. It was such a great experience! This time, I want to try out a new hotel. Once I figure out which one is the best, I'll head there and then find a good restaurant to eat at with my friends.
            I have a budget of 160 for the hotel, and I want to stay in a hotel with the higher rating.
            Can you recommend a hotel? Tell me the name, rating, price range, and address. Thanks a bunch!

Tool Output 1 (get_all_hotels_in_city): Hotel Names: Cozy Stay, Mom's Home, London Luxury, Covent Garden Retreat, Riverside View
Tool Output 2 (get_hotels_prices): {'Cozy Stay': 'Price range: 80.0 - 150.0', "Mom's Home": 'Price range: 80.0 - 150.0', 'London Luxury': 'Price range: 80.0 - 150.0', 'Covent Garden Retreat': 'Price range: 80.0 - 150.0', 'Riverside View': 'Price range: 200.0 - 350.0'}
Tool Output 3 (get_rating_reviews_for_hotels): {'Cozy Stay': "Rating: 4.7...", "Mom's Home": 'Rating: 4.5...', 'London Luxury': "Rating: 5.0...", 'Covent Garden Retreat': 'Rating: 4.3...'}
Tool Output 4 (get_hotels_address): {'Cozy Stay': '12 Leinster Gardens, Bayswater, London W2 3AN, United Kingdom'}

